KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Biology (Year 2021)

Q1. Which cell organelle is responsible for generating ATP via oxidative phosphorylation?
  (A) Ribosome
  (B) Mitochondrion
  (C) Golgi Body
  (D) Endoplasmic Reticulum
  Answer: B - Mitochondria produce ATP during cellular respiration.


